cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use SpectralBridge in research, please cite the software release you
  used.
title: 'SpectralBridge: Translating reflectance across sensors and scales'
type: software
version: 2.3.0rc1
abstract: SpectralBridge is a scientific Python package for translating reflectance
  across sensors and scales with restart-safe, file-based workflows.
repository-code: https://github.com/earthlab/spectralbridge
url: https://earthlab.github.io/spectralbridge/
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
- NEON
- hyperspectral
- remote sensing
- scientific infrastructure
- cross-sensor calibration
